WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.966 line:-3
Hi, I’m Vojta, and today I’ll show you,

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.633 line:-3
how to safely use Combo Ski

3
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:06.100 line:-3
and our Sever Gear poles.

4
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.633 line:-3
Combo Ski can be used in two modes.

5
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:12.166 line:-3
Snowshoe mode or mini-ski mode.

6
00:00:12.466 --> 00:00:16.033 line:-3
In snowshoe mode, I attach
only the middle pin

7
00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:18.333 line:-3
to the front keyhole-shaped mounting slot.

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.466 line:-3
In snowshoe mode, the metal spikes
must always be at the front,

9
00:00:23.466 --> 00:00:25.133 line:-3
The plastic end stays

10
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:27.733 line:-3
at the back, never at the
front. As I mentioned,

11
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.566 line:-3
I connect only one pin,

12
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:32.166 line:-3
The front pin remains unused.

13
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.533 line:-3
Now let’s switch to mini-ski mode.

14
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.966 line:-3
I release the pin,

15
00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:43.333 line:-3
and release the mounting
slot on the other side too.

16
00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:46.533 line:-3
and now I connect both pins.

17
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.300 line:-3
First the rear mounting
slot, then the front one.

18
00:00:52.633 --> 00:00:54.233 line:-3
The same on the other side.
